# Vendored voice assets are verbatim upstream artifacts from the sherpa-onnx
# tts-models release. Several espeak-ng data files are text, so without this
# Git rewrites their line endings on a Windows checkout and they stop matching
# upstream byte for byte. Treating the whole tree as binary keeps it verifiable
# against the published tarball.
app/src/main/assets/voices/** -text

# Wrapper and build scripts keep their upstream form too.
gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.onnx binary
